flowchart TD
  MapView -->|flag OFF: no requests| Gate[Existing feature flag]
  Gate -->|enabled + close zoom| API[Authenticated DealSifter Parcel API]
  API --> Resolver[PublicParcelResolver]
  Resolver --> FIPS[County GEOID / state FIPS]
  FIPS --> Registry[Typed ParcelSourceRegistry]
  Registry -->|ACTIVE + cleared license only| Adapter[PublicParcelProvider / ArcGISParcelAdapter]
  Adapter --> GIS[Allowlisted public GIS]
  GIS --> Cache[TTL cache / coalescing / backoff]
  Cache --> Evidence[CanonicalParcelEvidence: separate read model]
  Evidence --> MapView
  Resolver --> Geo[Existing geocode-address / cache]
  Evidence -. NOT YET ACTIVE .-> Maxxis[Maxxis / canonical property facts / reports]
